1
00:00:00,586 --> 00:00:02,256
(laughing):
My goodness!

2
00:00:02,254 --> 00:00:05,524
(Sheldon:)Do you remember
“comes with apsparagus”?

3
00:00:12,244 --> 00:00:14,144
(Sheldon:)Howard and Bernadette,

4
00:00:14,146 --> 00:00:16,146
(Sheldon:)you tried to comfort me
when I was ill,

5
00:00:16,148 --> 00:00:18,418
(Sheldon:)and I treated you terribly.

6
00:00:18,417 --> 00:00:20,017
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

7
00:00:20,019 --> 00:00:21,749
(Howard:)Wow.
(chuckles)

8
00:00:21,754 --> 00:00:22,984
(Howard:)I'm impressed.

9
00:00:22,988 --> 00:00:24,018
(Sheldon:)No, no, no, wait.

10
00:00:24,023 --> 00:00:25,093
(Sheldon:)I'm not done.

11
00:00:25,091 --> 00:00:27,221
(Sheldon:)Allow me to underscore
my sentiment

12
00:00:27,226 --> 00:00:28,996
(Sheldon:)with a haunting rendition

13
00:00:28,994 --> 00:00:30,824
of Brenda Lee's “I'm Sorry”

14
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,000
(Sheldon:)played on the pan flute.

15
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,970
Apology accepted!
Forgiven, forgiven!

16
00:00:36,969 --> 00:00:40,369
(Sheldon:)All right, that's eight hours
of practice down the drain.

17
00:00:42,508 --> 00:00:45,008
And to memorialize
this occasion,

18
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:47,910
(Sheldon:)here are your
commemorative T-shirts.

19
00:00:52,818 --> 00:00:56,018
“Sheldon Cooper
apologized to me”"

20
00:00:56,021 --> 00:01:00,021
“And he made it
all better.”

